OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder of woman and her
OL,4,Aniece in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has denied murdering
OL,7,Fa woman and her young niece in a house
OL,8,Ffire.
OL,10,FNatalie McDonald, 34, and
OL,11,Fseven-year-old Valentina Foster died in
OL,12,Fthe blaze in Grangetown, near
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough, in the early hours of 26
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FJaden Wright appeared at Teesside Crown
OL,17,FCourt via video link and denied two
OL,18,Fcounts of murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
